    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-article\"><header><strong>AmirMušić</strong><h1>如何将 AI 转化为动态设计（免费插件+指南）</h1></header><div class=\"tw-article-body\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">下面的视频获得了十万次观看。</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">我使用 AI shots 和 After Effects 进行后期制作完成了它。\n完整的.aep 项目（+其背后的每一个提示）包含在本文末尾。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">AI 可以生成精彩的素材，但仍需动态设计才能将那个镜头转化为成品。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">而且，还有一个巨大的问题……</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">*本文由 </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ltx_io\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">@ltx_io</span></a><span data-text=\"true\">。</span><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"> 感谢 LTX 团队支持这篇文章以及我为你所做的工作。</span></div></p>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2076959717323055105/img/XAiPYPMzhq8Ps_4D.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2076959717323055105/img/XAiPYPMzhq8Ps_4D.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">当前的 AI/编辑工作流程很糟糕</span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">现在，每一个新镜头都会打断你的节奏：</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">浏览器 → 生成 → 制作动画 → 下载 → 导入到 Ae → 重复</span></span></p>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" style=\"\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">AI 创建镜头。动态设计将它们转化为成品。\n我们的目标是将 AI 成果转化为有价值且值得付费的工作。</font></font></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">因此，我们开发了一个插件，帮助你创建工具，而不是为工具服务</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-php\">AI GENERATION\ncreates the raw shot\n        ↓\nTHE PLUGIN (FrameFlow)\nbrings generation into After Effects\n        ↓\nMOTION DESIGN\nturns it into finished, client-ready work</code></pre>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">FrameFlow 不是绕开动态设计的捷径，而是进入动态设计的捷径。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">为什么专业的 AI+编辑流水线很烂</span></span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每个使用 AI 内容和专业软件的人都会遇到同样的循环：</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLZnsQXYAAIpKT?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每次你需要微调某些内容时，你都会重复这个过程。\n这会打断思路并浪费时间。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">它能减少迭代次数 \n</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">——而更好的工作成果来自于</span><span data-text=\"true\">迭代 </span><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">。</span><span data-text=\"true\">那种摩擦不仅仅浪费时间。\n</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-java\">Export from Ae \n→ open a web tool \n→ upload the image \n→ generate video \n→ download it \n→ import back into After Effects \n→ manually place it in the right position and timing.</code></pre>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNOpg5HXUAEnUMc?format=png&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">解决方案</span></span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">LTX FrameFlow\n</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">我们构建了一个插件，它可以移除这个循环：\n</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNMzgj9WUAAW95o?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它允许你在 Ae 时间线中选择任何图像层，编写提示词，并在同一个合成中获取生成的视频。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它基于 LTX-2.3——目前表现最佳的开源视频模型之一。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">以下所有内容均为免费开源：插件、安装程序和完整提示词库。你唯一需要付费的是生成本身，通过 LTX API 按秒计费。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工作原理</span></span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工作流程很简单：</span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">选择时间轴上的一个图像图层</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">启动插件</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">写一个运动提示词</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">点击生成</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">视频出现在你的合成中，放置在原始图层上方</span></li></ol>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2076962426445037568/img/KjE4WGWOXYLTMiLU.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2076962426445037568/img/KjE4WGWOXYLTMiLU.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在 Ae 时间轴上选择图像，在 After Effects 中启动插件 → 窗口 → 扩展，然后在插件的提示区域输入您的提示，选择持续时间、帧率和质量 → 点击生成</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它如何改变你的工作</span></h2>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">大部分用于图像转视频的时间都花在了手动来回操作上。</font></font></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这个插件消除了那种开销。\n不必再在每次测试中浪费多达 12-15 分钟，你可以留在 After Effects 中继续工作。</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLa1xsXQAAgtrx?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如何设置它</span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">需求：</span></span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Adobe After Effects 2024 或更新版本</span></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span data-text=\"true\">LTX 账户 + API 密钥（用于 API 生成 - 插件本身是免费的）\n在此注册：<div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"//amirmushich.link/AMIR-LTX\"><span data-text=\"true\">amirmushich.link/AMIR-LTX</span></a></span></font></font></font></div></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">安装：</span></span></p>\n<ul><li><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"http://github.com/amirmushichge/LTX_FrameFlow\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">\n运行 CEP 安装程序并重启 After Effects — 完整步骤：</span></a><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Windows：</span>\n运行 CEP 安装程序并重启 After Effects — 完整步骤：github.com/amirmushichge/LTX_FrameFlow</font></font></font></div></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">macOS:\n<span data-text=\"true\">运行脚本 UI 安装程序并在首选项中启用脚本访问 — 完整步骤：</span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"http://github.com/amirmushichge/LTX_FrameFlow\"><span data-text=\"true\">github.com/amirmushichge/LTX_FrameFlow</span></a></font></font></font></div></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">安装后，通过打开插件</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-java\">After Effects → Window → Extensions → LTX FrameFlow.</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">使用插件</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每个控件在下面的截图中都有标注——保存它作为你的快速参考。</span></p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">粘贴并保存你的 LTX API 密钥（仅本地存储）\n</span><span data-text=\"true\">设置 / API 密钥\n</span></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">源图层\n<span data-text=\"true\">确认时间轴上选中了一个静态图像图层（而不仅仅是项目面板）</span></font></font></font></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">你的运动指令\n</span><span data-text=\"true\">提示字段\n</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">剪辑设置；成本估算实时更新\n</span><span data-text=\"true\">时长 / FPS / 引擎\n</span></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">生成视频\n<span data-text=\"true\">开始任务；MP4 文件会在完成后回到你的 Ae 项目中</span></font></font></font></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">输出和状态\nImport Above 保留源内容并在其上方添加 MP4，Hide Source 替换源内容；状态显示为就绪、生成中或错误</font></font></font></li></ul>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLbI83XAAAYLB_?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这张幻灯片上解释了所有控制器。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">把它保存为你的用户手册。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如何通过 LTX API 生成视频</span></span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">您需要一个 LTX 账户以及您自己的 LTX API 密钥。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">设置 API:</span></span></p>\n<ol><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">打开 LTX 开发者控制台：</span><span data-text=\"true\">\n</span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://console.ltx.video/\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://控制台.ltx.video</span></a><span data-text=\"true\">，登录，然后创建账户</span></div></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">打开 API 密钥部分 </span><span data-text=\"true\">，创建一个新密钥，然后复制它</span></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">在 After Effects</span><span data-text=\"true\"> 中,  \n打开 LTX FrameFlow → 点击齿轮按钮 → 粘贴并保存密钥</span></font></font></font></li></ol>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2076963434990604288/img/T2_vOQMNwTKNRV4P.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2076963434990604288/img/T2_vOQMNwTKNRV4P.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">账单:</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">按生成视频的每秒计费，通过 LTX 开发者控制台：</span></p>\n<blockquote><p><span style=\"font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">→ LTX 2.3 Fast / 1080p: 0.06 美元每秒\n→ LTX 2.3 Pro / 1080p：0.08 美元每秒\n→ LTX 2.3 Pro / 4K: 每秒 0.32 美元</span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在你点击生成之前，该面板会显示估计的片段成本。</span></p>\n<div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077015557241528320/img/o0ZRdHNDljc_hsCC.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/AmirMushich/status/2077062962657870049\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2077015557241528320/img/o0ZRdHNDljc_hsCC.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在你点击生成之前，该面板会显示估计的片段成本。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">官方 LTX 参考资料</span></span></p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">https://docs.ltx.video/认证\n</span><span data-text=\"true\"> </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://docs.ltx.video/authentication\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">认证和 API 密钥\n</span></a></div></li><li><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://docs.ltx.video/api-documentation/api-reference/async-video-generation/submit-image-to-video\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://docs.ltx.video/api-documentation/api-reference/async-video-generation/submit-image-to-video</span></a><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">图像转视频端点\n<span data-text=\"true\"> </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://docs.ltx.video/api-documentation/api-reference/async-video-generation/submit-image-to-video\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://docs.ltx.video/api-documentation/api-reference/async-video-generation/submit-image-to-video</span></a></div></font></font></font></div></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">定价:\n<span data-text=\"true\"> </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://docs.ltx.video/pricing\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://docs.ltx.video/pricing</span></a></font></font></font></div></li><li><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">自动充值\n<span data-text=\"true\"> </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://docs.ltx.video/auto-top-up\"><span data-text=\"true\">https://docs.ltx.video/auto-top-up</span></a></font></font></font></div></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">第一代</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">首先使用一个简短的测试。</span></span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">打开或创建一个 After Effects 合成。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">导入一张静态图像。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">将它放置在时间轴上。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在时间轴中选择图像图层。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">打开 LTX FrameFlow。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">确认面板显示源已被选中。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">撰写一个运动提示词</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">选择持续时间、FPS 和引擎。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">点击生成视频。</span></li></ol>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">推荐的首要设置：</span></span></p>\n<blockquote><p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">持续时间 </span>: 4-6 seconds\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">FPS</span>: 12 or 24\n<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">引擎 </span>:\n快速 / 1080p 用于更便宜的测试\n<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">Pro / 1080p</span><span data-text=\"true\"> 以获得更好的质量</span></font></font></font></p></blockquote>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">从小处开始。更长的片段会消耗更多时间和信用。</span></p>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">After Effects 中的提示</span></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">LTX 帧流的基础运动提示</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">将这些作为你自己镜头的起点。仅在必要时替换主体细节。</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">相机旋转</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLcVAKXUAA0rsO?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">180 度 Y 轴轨道</span></span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera performs a slow 180 degree rotation around the Y axis, \norbiting the subject in one smooth, continuous cinematic move. \nThe subject stays completely stable under soft, even light, with no warping.</code></pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">90度反射轨道</span></span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera slowly orbits 90 degrees around the object in a smooth arc, \nglossy reflections shifting naturally across the surface under premium studio lighting.</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">推送 / 拉取</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLcwzKWEAA1NiX?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">缓慢推入</span></span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera slowly pushes in toward the subject in one smooth cinematic move,\n creating subtle depth parallax between foreground and background while preserving \n the original image identity.</code></pre>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">缓慢拉镜头</span></span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera slowly dollies out, revealing more of the scene as the background \nshifts with gentle natural parallax, in a calm cinematic motion with no distortion.</code></pre>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">视差</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLc_SZXcAA1D3F?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">正向浮动视差</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera floats gently forward, the foreground drifting slightly faster \nthan the background to create subtle, realistic parallax depth.</code></pre>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">手持微运动</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera drifts with gentle handheld micro-movement, \nrevealing natural depth separation between layers while the subject stays stable, \nwith no melting or heavy deformation.</code></pre>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">产品 / 对象</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLdOxfXkAAAFYC?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">产品轨道</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera slowly orbits around the product in a smooth arc, \nglossy reflections moving naturally across the surface, \nshot with shallow depth of field under premium studio light.</code></pre>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">静态主视觉图</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera holds a static hero shot of the product as subtle \nreflections shift and a soft light sweep passes across the surface, \ncreating a calm cinematic atmosphere.</code></pre>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">风景 / 自然</span></span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">飘云盘</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">Clouds drift slowly across the sky as grass sways gently in the wind below, \nsoft sunlight bathing the scene while the camera moves in a slow cinematic pan.</code></pre>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">左平移景观</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera pans gently left across the landscape, \nrevealing atmospheric depth as the wind moves realistically through the scene.</code></pre>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">图形/设计框架</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLdkbjW4AAm5CB?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">推入图层视差</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera slowly pushes in toward the frame, creating a clean \nparallax shift between the graphic layers as a soft glow moves across crisp, \nundistorted edges. Stable typography, no text deformation.</code></pre>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">浮动光扫</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera floats slowly across the frame as delicate light shifts gently, \ntypography staying completely stable and sharp with no text deformation.</code></pre>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">概览 / 细节</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNLdzAcWAAAud49?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">宏观表面漂移</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera drifts slowly across the surface in macro close-up, \ncatching soft specular highlights with a shallow depth of field in calm, \npremium cinematic motion.</code></pre>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">缓慢向上倾斜</span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">The camera tilts slowly upward, catching tiny shifts in reflections \nwhile the atmosphere stays calm and all details are preserved, with no warping.</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">LTX-2.3 的提示原则\n图像到视频</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNMnKX5WgAA87Ih?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">LTX-2.3 提示指南（官方）- 链接如下</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">LTX-2.3 对以电影摄影师描述镜头的方式写出的完整、流畅句子的回应效果最佳，而非由零散关键词组成的列表。让上述每条提示都能生效的三条规则是：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">写一个包含动词的流畅句子，而不是关键词列表：</span><span data-text=\"true\">\n随着主体转动，相机缓慢推近\" 相当于 \"推近，主体转动，电影感\"</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">顺序很重要：</span><span data-text=\"true\"> 先行动，最后才是摄影和灯光。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">在重写提示词之前，将相同的提示词运行 2 到 3 次：</span><span data-text=\"true\">\nLTX-2.3 存在一定的运行间差异；首次结果不佳并不总是意味着提示词糟糕。</span></li></ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">进一步阅读</span></span></p>\n<ul><li><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://ltx.io/blog/ltx-2-3-prompt-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">LTX-2.3 提示指南 (官方)</span></a></div></li><li><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://ltx.io/blog/how-to-improve-ltx-2-3-prompt-adherence\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如何提高 LTX-2.3 提示遵循度（官方）</span></a></div></li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h2><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">🎁 获取我的作品集项目（AEP + 提示词）</font></font></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如开头承诺的那样——这是我的完整展示片：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">After Effects 项目：</span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1bV5z1JT4_FQY2bQtCJ4ppTfLpQDOmxeq?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">Google Drive 文件夹</span></a></div></li><li><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">每次使用的提示词，逐帧：</span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1H6Z-4eLLQSD_O7F_mabmV_3rVjYYn9Xtan_WEzSm-Is/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\"> 预告片提示词文档</span></a></div></li></ul>\n<div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HNMnuqgX0AAmTKF?format=jpg&name=large\" alt=\"Image\" /></div>\n<hr>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最终思考</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在专业视频软件中生成素材是创意能量的助推器。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你没有花在导出、上传和重新导入上的每一分钟，都是实际用于镜头迭代的一分钟。这些迭代正是让你更接近一个“出色”且“具有商业价值”的输出。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">安装 FrameFlow 插件，运行你的第一次生成，然后去创建一些对你的客户（或你的动态）来说具有颠覆性的东西。</span></p>\n<p><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/@AmirMushich\" target=\"_blank\"><span data-text=\"true\">@AmirMushich</span></a><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\" data-imt-deferred-display=\"\" style=\"display: none;\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-inner immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background-inner\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\"><span data-text=\"true\">保存这篇文章 &amp; 关注 </span><div class=\"css-175oi2r r-1loqt21 r-1471scf r-o7ynqc r-6416eg r-1ny4l3l\"><a href=\"https://x.com/@AmirMushich\"><span data-text=\"true\">@AmirMushich</span></a></div><span data-text=\"true\"> 了解更多免费工具知识。\n我每天分享这些。</span></font></font></font></div></p></div></article>",
    "pageContent": "下面的视频获得了十万次观看。\n我使用 AI shots 和 After Effects 进行后期制作完成了它。\n完整的.aep 项目（+其背后的每一个提示）包含在本文末尾。\nAI 可以生成精彩的素材，但仍需动态设计才能将那个镜头转化为成品。\n而且，还有一个巨大的问题……\n*本文由 @ltx_io。 感谢 LTX 团队支持这篇文章以及我为你所做的工作。\n0:30\n当前的 AI/编辑工作流程很糟糕\n现在，每一个新镜头都会打断你的节奏：\n浏览器 → 生成 → 制作动画 → 下载 → 导入到 Ae → 重复\nAI 创建镜头。动态设计将它们转化为成品。\n我们的目标是将 AI 成果转化为有价值且值得付费的工作。\n因此，我们开发了一个插件，帮助你创建工具，而不是为工具服务\nphp\nAI GENERATION\ncreates the raw shot ↓\nTHE PLUGIN (FrameFlow)\nbrings generation into After Effects ↓\nMOTION DESIGN\nturns it into finished, client-ready work\nFrameFlow 不是绕开动态设计的捷径，而是进入动态设计的捷径。\n为什么专业的 AI+编辑流水线很烂\n每个使用 AI 内容和专业软件的人都会遇到同样的循环：\n每次你需要微调某些内容时，你都会重复这个过程。\n这会打断思路并浪费时间。\n它能减少迭代次数 ——而更好的工作成果来自于迭代 。那种摩擦不仅仅浪费时间。 java\nExport from Ae → open a web tool → upload the image → generate video → download it → import back into After Effects → manually place it in the right position and timing.\n解决方案\nLTX FrameFlow\n我们构建了一个插件，它可以移除这个循环： 它允许你在 Ae 时间线中选择任何图像层，编写提示词，并在同一个合成中获取生成的视频。\n它基于 LTX-2.3——目前表现最佳的开源视频模型之一。\n以下所有内容均为免费开源：插件、安装程序和完整提示词库。你唯一需要付费的是生成本身，通过 LTX API 按秒计费。\n工作原理\n工作流程很简单：\n选择时间轴上的一个图像图层\n启动插件\n写一个运动提示词\n点击生成\n视频出现在你的合成中，放置在原始图层上方\n在 Ae 时间轴上选择图像，在 After Effects 中启动插件 → 窗口 → 扩展，然后在插件的提示区域输入您的提示，选择持续时间、帧率和质量 → 点击生成\n它如何改变你的工作\n这个插件消除了那种开销。\n不必再在每次测试中浪费多达 12-15 分钟，你可以留在 After Effects 中继续工作。\n如何设置它\n需求：\nAdobe After Effects 2024 或更新版本\n安装： 运行 CEP 安装程序并重启 After Effects — 完整步骤：\n安装后，通过打开插件\njava\nAfter Effects → Window → Extensions → LTX FrameFlow.\n使用插件\n每个控件在下面的截图中都有标注——保存它作为你的快速参考。\n粘贴并保存你的 LTX API 密钥（仅本地存储）\n设置 / API 密钥 你的运动指令\n提示字段 剪辑设置；成本估算实时更新\n时长 / FPS / 引擎 这张幻灯片上解释了所有控制器。\n把它保存为你的用户手册。\n如何通过 LTX API 生成视频\n您需要一个 LTX 账户以及您自己的 LTX API 密钥。\n设置 API:\n打开 LTX 开发者控制台：\nhttps://控制台.ltx.video，登录，然后创建账户\n打开 API 密钥部分 ，创建一个新密钥，然后复制它\n账单:\n按生成视频的每秒计费，通过 LTX 开发者控制台：\n→ LTX 2.3 Fast / 1080p: 0.06 美元每秒\n→ LTX 2.3 Pro / 1080p：0.08 美元每秒\n→ LTX 2.3 Pro / 4K: 每秒 0.32 美元\n在你点击生成之前，该面板会显示估计的片段成本。\n在你点击生成之前，该面板会显示估计的片段成本。\n官方 LTX 参考资料\nhttps://docs.ltx.video/认证 认证和 API 密钥 https://docs.ltx.video/api-documentation/api-reference/async-video-generation/submit-image-to-video\n第一代\n首先使用一个简短的测试。\n打开或创建一个 After Effects 合成。\n导入一张静态图像。\n将它放置在时间轴上。\n在时间轴中选择图像图层。\n打开 LTX FrameFlow。\n确认面板显示源已被选中。\n撰写一个运动提示词\n选择持续时间、FPS 和引擎。\n点击生成视频。\n推荐的首要设置：\n从小处开始。更长的片段会消耗更多时间和信用。\nAfter Effects 中的提示\nLTX 帧流的基础运动提示\n将这些作为你自己镜头的起点。仅在必要时替换主体细节。\n相机旋转\n180 度 Y 轴轨道\nThe camera performs a slow 180 degree rotation around the Y axis, orbiting the subject in one smooth, continuous cinematic move. The subject stays completely stable under soft, even light, with no warping.\n90度反射轨道\nThe camera slowly orbits 90 degrees around the object in a smooth arc, glossy reflections shifting naturally across the surface under premium studio lighting.\n推送 / 拉取\n缓慢推入\nThe camera slowly pushes in toward the subject in one smooth cinematic move, creating subtle depth parallax between foreground and background while preserving the original image identity.\n缓慢拉镜头\nThe camera slowly dollies out, revealing more of the scene as the background shifts with gentle natural parallax, in a calm cinematic motion with no distortion.\n视差\n正向浮动视差\nThe camera floats gently forward, the foreground drifting slightly faster than the background to create subtle, realistic parallax depth.\n手持微运动\nThe camera drifts with gentle handheld micro-movement, revealing natural depth separation between layers while the subject stays stable, with no melting or heavy deformation.\n产品 / 对象\n产品轨道\nThe camera slowly orbits around the product in a smooth arc, glossy reflections moving naturally across the surface, shot with shallow depth of field under premium studio light.\n静态主视觉图\nThe camera holds a static hero shot of the product as subtle reflections shift and a soft light sweep passes across the surface, creating a calm cinematic atmosphere.\n风景 / 自然\n飘云盘\nClouds drift slowly across the sky as grass sways gently in the wind below, soft sunlight bathing the scene while the camera moves in a slow cinematic pan.\n左平移景观\nThe camera pans gently left across the landscape, revealing atmospheric depth as the wind moves realistically through the scene.\n图形/设计框架\n推入图层视差\nThe camera slowly pushes in toward the frame, creating a clean parallax shift between the graphic layers as a soft glow moves across crisp, undistorted edges. Stable typography, no text deformation.\n浮动光扫\nThe camera floats slowly across the frame as delicate light shifts gently, typography staying completely stable and sharp with no text deformation.\n概览 / 细节\n宏观表面漂移\nThe camera drifts slowly across the surface in macro close-up, catching soft specular highlights with a shallow depth of field in calm, premium cinematic motion.\n缓慢向上倾斜\nThe camera tilts slowly upward, catching tiny shifts in reflections while the atmosphere stays calm and all details are preserved, with no warping.\nLTX-2.3 的提示原则\n图像到视频\nLTX-2.3 提示指南（官方）- 链接如下\nLTX-2.3 对以电影摄影师描述镜头的方式写出的完整、流畅句子的回应效果最佳，而非由零散关键词组成的列表。让上述每条提示都能生效的三条规则是：\n写一个包含动词的流畅句子，而不是关键词列表：\n随着主体转动，相机缓慢推近\" 相当于 \"推近，主体转动，电影感\"\n顺序很重要： 先行动，最后才是摄影和灯光。\n在重写提示词之前，将相同的提示词运行 2 到 3 次：\nLTX-2.3 存在一定的运行间差异；首次结果不佳并不总是意味着提示词糟糕。\n进一步阅读\nLTX-2.3 提示指南 (官方)\n如何提高 LTX-2.3 提示遵循度（官方）\n如开头承诺的那样——这是我的完整展示片：\nAfter Effects 项目：Google Drive 文件夹\n每次使用的提示词，逐帧： 预告片提示词文档\n最终思考\n在专业视频软件中生成素材是创意能量的助推器。\n你没有花在导出、上传和重新导入上的每一分钟，都是实际用于镜头迭代的一分钟。这些迭代正是让你更接近一个“出色”且“具有商业价值”的输出。\n安装 FrameFlow 插件，运行你的第一次生成，然后去创建一些对你的客户（或你的动态）来说具有颠覆性的东西。\n@AmirMushich"
  },
